+        b"q 30 170 130 80 re W* n q 800 0 0 900 -300 -400 cm /Im0 Do Q BT /F1 12 Tf 30 195 Td (Shared caption) Tj ET Q BT /F1 12 Tf 30 130 Td (Editable caption) Tj ET",
