+# Product and technology names (PdfCraft, PDF, Acrobat JavaScript ...) stay as they are;
+# the trailing "…" of dialog commands is kept. Commands use the noun form ("Salvare", "Deschidere…"),
+# messages address the user formally ("Alegeți", "dvs.").
